{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>MIRROR成員陳卓賢（Ian）於啟德體藝館舉辦一連九場的個人演唱會，今日（23日）是首場，搭正20:23分演唱會正式開始。Ian一出場連唱三首歌，分別是：《鯨落》、《抱抱無尾熊》及《Thank You Postman》。</p><figure><img alt=\"MIRROR成員陳卓賢（Ian）於啟德體藝館舉辦一連九場的個人演唱會。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157070283874504704138275.jpeg/sxoqZMY9mC7Pca8gNbE7Or0CDm-SiXqKyH03QeF9N0E\"/><figcaption>MIRROR成員陳卓賢（Ian）於啟德體藝館舉辦一連九場的個人演唱會。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>陳卓賢落台小休再上台狀態大勇</p><p>不過當他唱到第三首《Thank You Postman》時，未知是否第一場未熱身，唱到高音位時有些少不穩定，他立即收拾情緒唱下去，唱完之後便到台下先休息一會，再上台時狀態大勇，唱得十分穩定。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳卓賢一口氣連唱三首人氣歌。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157070511143260160530781.jpeg/aOxE2BD9SD019pbEx_XxDhJ6Z0GJNFATdoP9L1-D_S8\"/><figcaption>陳卓賢一口氣連唱三首人氣歌。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳卓賢開騷。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157070508769153024791536.jpeg/ywjtDmfNI_4Q-SWnt0g9QOu6pt2DVn5uBnWOky91jpM\"/><figcaption>陳卓賢開騷。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳卓賢（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157070506541846528021457.jpeg/APoARww5plO9afwPv08KpKsViwQDtehj5Jj8Xs2Y_F4\"/><figcaption>陳卓賢（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ian。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157070504104824832681250.jpeg/3glPbl3xT-TqKxY-C6K1T8u23Nj6bXJBgJXxjqmV8Y4\"/><figcaption>Ian。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T13:38:56.357155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":5,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}